[{"explanations":["Vill + infinitive tala.","Talar is present, wrong after vill.","Att tala adds a word vill forbids."],"kind":"choice","options":["Jag vill tala.","Jag vill talar.","Jag vill att tala."],"prompt":"“I want to speak.” Pick the correct sentence."},{"explanations":["Kan + infinitive bo.","Bor is present.","Att bo adds forbidden att."],"kind":"choice","options":["Hon kan bo här.","Hon kan bor här.","Hon kan att bo här."],"prompt":"“She can live here.” Pick the correct sentence."},{"explanations":["Måste + infinitive jobba.","Jobbar is present.","Att jobba adds forbidden att."],"kind":"choice","options":["Vi måste jobba idag.","Vi måste jobbar idag.","Vi måste att jobba idag."],"prompt":"“We must work today.” Pick the correct sentence."},{"explanations":["Ska + infinitive fråga.","Frågar is present.","Att fråga adds forbidden att."],"kind":"choice","options":["Han ska fråga Anna.","Han ska frågar Anna.","Han ska att fråga Anna."],"prompt":"“He will ask Anna.” Pick the correct sentence."},{"explanations":["Vill = want.","Kan = can.","Måste = must."],"kind":"choice","options":["Jag vill prata.","Jag kan prata.","Jag måste prata."],"prompt":"Which means “I want to talk.”?"},{"explanations":["Måste = must.","Vill = want.","Kan = can."],"kind":"choice","options":["Jag måste prata.","Jag vill prata.","Jag kan prata."],"prompt":"Which means “I must talk.”?"},{"explanations":["Ska = plan / will.","Vill = want.","Kan = can."],"kind":"choice","options":["Jag ska prata.","Jag vill prata.","Jag kan prata."],"prompt":"Which means “I will talk.”?"},{"explanations":["Subject first, then helper.","Helper first is a question, not a statement.","Infinitive first is wrong order."],"kind":"choice","options":["Jag vill tala.","Vill jag tala.","Tala jag vill."],"prompt":"Pick the correct word order."},{"explanations":["Kan stanna: helper + infinitive.","Stannar is present after helper.","Att stanna adds forbidden att."],"kind":"choice","options":["Du kan stanna här.","Du kan stannar här.","Du kan att stanna här."],"prompt":"“You can stay here.” Pick the correct sentence."},{"explanations":["Kalla is the infinitive after ska.","Kallar is present.","Att kalla adds forbidden att."],"kind":"choice","options":["De ska kalla Erik.","De ska kallar Erik.","De ska att kalla Erik."],"prompt":"“They will call Erik.” Pick the correct sentence."}]